# EnterWorktree creates nested git worktrees here. They are working copies of
# this same repo (each with its own diverged evidence_evaluator/ and tests/),
# not content to track -- committing one would create the exact two-copies
# failure mode this project's source workspace exists to prevent.
.claude/worktrees/
